  "description": "\"You son of a bitch. I regret having someone like you as a friend.\"\n\nI was taken in by Yoon Cha-Heon, with whom I had formed a relationship as a patron, filling the void left by my parents who passed away in an accident.\n\nI knew that this choice would lead to a life close to Yoon Cha-Heon's attachment doll... but there was no other way, as I couldn't escape it.\n\nYoon Cha-Heon caused incidents and accidents to gain my attention, and as I was enduring the shared punishment, thinking only that if I lived as quietly as a mouse for just one year, I could be free...\n\n\"My dick just got hard from the first time I saw you. Is that enough?\"\n\nI face Seo Je-Hwi, a vulgar, frivolous, and strange delinquent, again.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561017297), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14626604)",
